<title>FRANCE: Essilor statement due just after close.</title>
<headline>Essilor statement due just after close.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French contact lenses group Essilor will make a statement shortly after the 1600 GMT bourse closing following a board meeting, an Essilor spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>She declined to comment on the subject of the statement.</p>
<p>Essilor shares were suspended earlier on Wednesday pending a statement.</p>
</text>
